<title>UK: OPEC basket price $21.66 on Friday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price $21.66 on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of the OPEC basket of seven crudes stood at $21.66 a barrel on Friday, against $21.84 the previous day, the OPECNA news agency said, quoting the OPEC secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
